/* JH (01/14/2006) function that steps through the valid IR nodes in the 
 * memory pool and initializes the data member in class SgAwaitExpressionStroageClass
 * from its counterpart of SgAwaitExpression. The return value is just for checking, 
 * that the whole StorageClassArray is initialized!
 */
